        "text": "\"consume_event.py\" has been created in the current working directory. It uses Google Cloud Pub/Sub to consume one message from a subscription, making the provider identifiable through the `google.cloud.pubsub_v1` import and the use of `project_id` and `subscription_id` variables.\n",
